/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115180/extras/678e80fd8db88ef6624b55e898dc19e9.avif?t=1734045669\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY PIECES</h2>Uncover what happened to the shopkeeper, meet the villagers, encounter rivals and write your own self into the place.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115180/extras/e0bb56479666cabc75db210451471700.avif?t=1734045669\" /></div>",
